llery-Banner-1.jpg 570w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" title="Glass Water Features 1"></picture></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1f273cd elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="1f273cd" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-eafcf61" data-id="eafcf61" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-edf92b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="edf92b2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" width="2048" height="1365" src="/wp-content/uploads/Frameless-Glass-Water-Wall-for-Peoples-Bank-in-Eva-jpg.avif" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-103610" alt="Frameless Glass Water Wall for Peoples Bank in Eva" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Frameless-Glass-Water-Wall-for-Peoples-Bank-in-Eva-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Frameless-Glass-Water-Wall-for-Peoples-Bank-in-Eva-jpg-768x512.avif 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Frameless-Glass-Water-Wall-for-Peoples-Bank-in-Eva-jpg-800x533.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Frameless-Glass-Water-Wall-for-Peoples-Bank-in-Eva-jpg-1440x960.avif 1440w, /wp-content/uploads/Frameless-Glass-Water-Wall-for-Peoples-Bank-in-Eva-jpg.avif 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px" title="Glass Water Features 2"></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-38257d6" data-id="38257d6" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-be02a51 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="be02a51" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h2>Why Midwest Tropical?</h2><p>Midwest Tropical is the company that pioneered many advances in the indoor water feature and indoor waterfall fountain market. Since the 1970s, we have been fabricating and designing beautiful water features and glass water walls for hotels, casinos, doctors’ offices, office buildings, retail locations and even luxury homes throughout the United States. Our maintenance-free water walls and bubble tubes give you the benefits of a glass water feature without the maintenance of an aquarium. Thus, allowing you to benefit your customers and clients without added stress on your plate. We handle every aspect of our process in the United States — from the initial design to the fabrication of your water feature and the eventual turnkey installation. Because we control the entire process, the result is a beautiful and functional water feature that you will be proud to own. Is a glass water feature what you need to transform your space? Midwest Tropical makes it easy. <a href="/contact-us/">Contact us</a> to start designing and building your custom water feature today.</p></div></div></div></div></section><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5c3082c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="5c3082c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f907c47 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="f907c47" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4abb5a8 elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="4abb5a8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widge